[For "white"]
[Kind "main"]
[Start "caro-w-main 7.Qb3"]
[Name "7...Qc8: the quiet guard"]

7... Qc8 { Guards b7 and keeps the queen away from Ne5. It is passive, but sound. }
8. Nd2 { The same plan: the knight gets out of the way so that the other can go to f3. }
8... e6
9. Ngf3 Be7
10. O-O { With the queen on c8 there is no fork on e5, so White simply castles. [%idea castle-early] }
10... O-O
11. Rfe1 { The rook takes the open file, and the game is about level with a small edge for White. [%idea open-file] } *
